      "id": "ewt-test-014",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-blogspot.com_floppingaces_20041126180010_ENG_20041126_180010-0009",
      "tokens": 24,
      "text": "This Fallujah operation my turn out to be the most important operation done by the US Military since the end of the war."
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-015",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-blogspot.com_marketview_20050224181500_ENG_20050224_181500-0002",
      "tokens": 12,
      "text": "I'm not fond of the Google-hates-privacy argument"
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-016",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-blogspot.com_marketview_20050224181500_ENG_20050224_181500-0004",
      "tokens": 9,
      "text": "However, this toolbar is really bad news."
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-017",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-blogspot.com_grandpasgripes_20060413051000_ENG_20060413_051000-0001",
      "tokens": 12,
      "text": "Iran says it is creating nuclear energy without wanting nuclear weapons."
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-018",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-blogspot.com_grandpasgripes_20060413051000_ENG_20060413_051000-0002",
      "tokens": 10,
      "text": "The United States doesn't believe the Iranian Government."
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-019",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-blogspot.com_grandpasgripes_20060413051000_ENG_20060413_051000-0004",
      "tokens": 6,
      "text": "But there is no proof ."
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-020",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-blogspot.com_grandpasgripes_20060413051000_ENG_20060413_051000-0006",
      "tokens": 18,
      "text": "They are certainly being nasty to the United Nations Security Council in connection with the anti-proliferation treaty."
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-021",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-blogspot.com_grandpasgripes_20060413051000_ENG_20060413_051000-0008",
      "tokens": 13,
      "text": "But he has insisted that he wants nuclear power for peaceful purposes."
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-022",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-blogspot.com_grandpasgripes_20060413051000_ENG_20060413_051000-0009",
      "tokens": 13,
      "text": "Many people want to use diplomacy with Iran rather than military pressure."
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-023",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-blogspot.com_grandpasgripes_20060413051000_ENG_20060413_051000-0010",
      "tokens": 5,
      "text": "But will diplomacy work?"
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-024",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-blogspot.com_grandpasgripes_20060413051000_ENG_20060413_051000-0011",
      "tokens": 9,
      "text": "And can anyone use military pressure without proof?"
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-025",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-blogspot.com_grandpasgripes_20060413051000_ENG_20060413_051000-0013",
      "tokens": 5,
      "text": "He has denied this."
    },
