      "sourceSent": "weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20041018060600_ENG_20041018_060600-0014",
      "tokens": 14,
      "text": "They also had a special connection to some extremists in Jordan and Germany."
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-091",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20041018060600_ENG_20041018_060600-0019",
      "tokens": 16,
      "text": "These have been sighted among Iraqi crowds on Haifa Street in Baghdad and in Samarra."
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-092",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20041018060600_ENG_20041018_060600-0020",
      "tokens": 19,
      "text": "So now there are hundreds of al-Qaeda members in Iraq where there had been none before."
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-093",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20040722101300_ENG_20040722_101300-0001",
      "tokens": 11,
      "text": "The September 11 Panel will issue its findings on Thursday."
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-094",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20040722101300_ENG_20040722_101300-0002",
      "tokens": 20,
      "text": "It notes 10 points at which the US made key mistakes that might have stopped Bin Laden's plot."
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-095",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20040722101300_ENG_20040722_101300-0003",
      "tokens": 11,
      "text": "Four of these were under Clinton and 6 under Bush."
    },
