      "id": "ewt-test-096",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20040722101300_ENG_20040722_101300-0005",
      "tokens": 17,
      "text": "This statement is, despite its facade of fair-mindedness, so many weasel words."
