      "id": "ewt-test-099",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20040722101300_ENG_20040722_101300-0009",
      "tokens": 15,
      "text": "We now know that Bush and his administration came into office obsessed with Iraq."
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt-test-100",
      "sourceSent": "weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20040722101300_ENG_20040722_101300-0013",
      "tokens": 14,
      "text": "Even after the attacks on September 11, Bush was obsessing about Iraq."
