      "sourceSent": "weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20040722101300_ENG_20040722_101300-0016",
      "tokens": 24,
      "text": "The hijackers were obviously al-Qaeda, and no operational links between al-Qaeda and Iraq had ever been found)."
