      "sourceSent": "weblog-juancole.com_juancole_20040722101300_ENG_20040722_101300-0018",
      "tokens": 24,
      "text": "(What about 40 al-Qaeda bases that had trained the 9/11 hijackers and other terrorists gunning for the United States??)"
